@startuml
title Neutral foundation release lifecycle

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontColor #102027
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #455A64
  FontColor #102027
  StartColor #1565C0
  EndColor #455A64
}

[*] --> Initial
state "Initial\nselect adversarial scenario" as Initial #ECEFF1
state "Canonical wire\nprofile, outcome, identity domains" as Canonical #C8E6C9
state "Analysis graph\nstrength, relation, atomic patch" as Graph #A5D6A7
state "Runtime\nresult axes, locks, cache, spill, resume" as Runtime #81C784
state "Requirements\nrevision, tombstone, source accounting" as Requirements #66BB6A
state "Assurance\nauthority, freshness, controls, attestation" as Assurance #FFCC80
state "Documentation\nmanifest, claim rules, check-only lint" as Documentation #CE93D8
state "Released\nevery gate holds" as Released #4CAF50
state "Rejected\nat least one gate fails" as Rejected #EF9A9A

Initial --> Canonical : canonicalize
Canonical --> Graph : build neutral graph
Graph --> Runtime : execute under locked inputs
Runtime --> Requirements : preserve requirement history
Requirements --> Assurance : evaluate evidence
Assurance --> Documentation : validate generated assets and claims
Documentation --> Released : exact release predicate is true
Documentation --> Rejected : exact release predicate is false
Released --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]

note right of Runtime #FFF3E0
  Incomplete results never enter complete-only caches.
  Overflow uses repository-backed storage, never tmpfs.
end note

note right of Assurance #FFEBEE
  Statistics and bounded models do not discharge
  an unbounded theorem obligation.
end note

note bottom of Documentation #F3E5F5
  Check-only lint is non-mutating.
  A stale generated-asset manifest cannot pass.
end note

legend right
  |= Color |= Contract family |
  |<#ECEFF1> | lifecycle control |
  |<#C8E6C9> | canonical and graph data |
  |<#81C784> | runtime execution |
  |<#FFCC80> | assurance authority |
  |<#CE93D8> | documentation governance |
  |<#4CAF50> | released |
  |<#EF9A9A> | rejected |
endlegend
@enduml
